      "workstream": "Design",
      "title": "ISO CAN Transceiver system design",
      "description": "Table of Jetson CAN Com information",
      "ownerLabel": "Dexi Li",
      "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
      "plannedStart": "2026-09-01",
      "plannedEnd": "2026-09-06",
      "stage": "DESIGN",
      "priority": "MEDIUM",
      "link": "1. DEXI - Electrical System Brief\n2. Design manual ISO CAN Texas Instrument",
      "subtasks": [
        "Table of Wheel motor CAN information (AK10-9 v2.0) + Datasheet linked + Add to drive",
        "Table: Robot Arm CAN information (Link+drive)",
        "Record the arm length, bus cable length (at least the estimated)",
        "Calculate maximum stub length (if possible)",
        "Find the cable link (shielded) + Note: Avoid close to the battery",
        "How much propagation delay it has (optional, if not possible, try simulation)",
